    "module_designation": "Analogue data processing unit",
    "description": "Analogue data processing unit type X1309-TR is a separate module intended to be integrated in a non automatic weighing instrument. It is in the form of an electronic card that is closed with a metallic cover. It is intended to be connected to a weighing channel comprising strain gauges load-cells with analogue output. It performs analogue to digital conversion of the signal and has in its memory all setting parameters of the whole instrument as well as the signature of the associated terminal. Sealing is by a sealing sticker intended to prevent access to the card."
